```
Stage 3 — DCSync Detection
Event ID 4662 tagged with directory replication GUID (1131f6aa-9c07-11d1-f79f-00c04fc2dcd2)

Lab query:
```

index=wineventlog EventCode=4662 "1131f6aa-9c07-11d1-f79f-00c04fc2dcd2"
| table _time Account_Name Client_Address

```
Production-tuned variant (excludes legitimate DC-to-DC replication noise):
```

index=wineventlog EventCode=4662 "1131f6aa-9c07-11d1-f79f-00c04fc2dcd2"
Account_Name!="*$"
| table _time Account_Name Client_Address

```
This detection fires only after replication has occurred. The durable control is
auditing DS-Replication-Get-Changes / DS-Replication-Get-Changes-All grants on
the domain object — see README Stage 3 "Detection Gap" for the full writeup.
```
